{"task":"transcribe","language":"english","duration":22.709999084472656,"text":"It was 10 o'clock at night. The city gets very hot at night in the summer. There was nowhere to go, really, was there? I was walking around in circles, trying to get my mind right. Back and forth, back and forth, go this way, no, go this way, no. What did it matter? Which way I went?","words":[{"word":"It","start":0.0,"end":0.47999998927116394},{"word":"was","start":0.47999998927116394,"end":0.6399999856948853},{"word":"10","start":0.6399999856948853,"end":0.8799999952316284},{"word":"o","start":0.8799999952316284,"end":1.100000023841858},{"word":"clock","start":1.100000023841858,"end":1.100000023841858},{"word":"at","start":1.100000023841858,"end":1.399999976158142},{"word":"night","start":1.399999976158142,"end":1.5399999618530273},{"word":"The","start":2.440000057220459,"end":2.559999942779541},{"word":"city","start":2.559999942779541,"end":2.700000047683716},{"word":"gets","start":2.700000047683716,"end":2.940000057220459},{"word":"very","start":2.940000057220459,"end":3.299999952316284},{"word":"hot","start":3.299999952316284,"end":3.5399999618530273},{"word":"at","start":3.5399999618530273,"end":4.0},{"word":"night","start":4.0,"end":4.21999979019165},{"word":"in","start":4.21999979019165,"end":4.579999923706055},{"word":"the","start":4.579999923706055,"end":4.980000019073486},{"word":"summer","start":4.980000019073486,"end":4.980000019073486},{"word":"There","start":6.21999979019165,"end":6.320000171661377},{"word":"was","start":6.320000171661377,"end":6.5},{"word":"nowhere","start":6.5,"end":6.559999942779541},{"word":"to","start":6.559999942779541,"end":6.800000190734863},{"word":"go","start":6.800000190734863,"end":7.039999961853027},{"word":"really","start":7.119999885559082,"end":7.460000038146973},{"word":"was","start":7.460000038146973,"end":7.820000171661377},{"word":"there","start":7.820000171661377,"end":8.020000457763672},{"word":"I","start":8.600000381469727,"end":9.03